# Pin the generated doc-dates file to LF on all platforms.
#
# `scripts/generate-doc-dates.ts` writes LF, and `scripts/check-doc-dates.ts`
# compares against it. Without this, Windows `core.autocrlf=true`
# rematerializes the committed file as CRLF in the working tree, and the
# lint:doc-dates gate would false-fail "stale" on every Windows build.
# (The gate also normalizes EOLs defensively, but pinning keeps the
# working copy consistent so the file isn't churned on checkout.)
server/doc-dates.json text eol=lf
